WEBVTT

00:15.670 --> 00:18.500
I never dreamed before

00:18.500 --> 00:21.340
I'm gonna knock the door

00:21.340 --> 00:24.910
into the world of perfect free

00:24.910 --> 00:27.010
(You ain't no lonely!)

00:27.010 --> 00:29.850
You're gonna say I'm lying

00:29.850 --> 00:32.580
I'm gonna get the chance

00:32.580 --> 00:36.150
I thought a chance is far from me

00:36.150 --> 00:37.320
(You ain't no lonely!)

00:37.320 --> 00:40.230
I was made to hit in America

00:40.230 --> 00:43.090
(I was made to hit in America)

00:43.090 --> 00:49.000
I was made to hit in America

00:49.000 --> 00:52.670
You are the sun, you are the star

00:52.670 --> 00:54.670
(To me, forever)

00:54.670 --> 00:58.380
You are the sun, you are the star

00:58.380 --> 01:01.610
(To me, forever)

01:08.450 --> 01:14.060
I was made to hit in America

01:14.060 --> 01:16.900
I was made to hit in America

01:16.900 --> 01:19.760
(I was made to hit in America)

01:19.760 --> 01:22.570
I was made to hit in America

01:22.570 --> 01:25.340
(I was made to hit in America)

01:25.340 --> 01:33.210
I was made to hit in America

01:36.250 --> 01:41.620
"Fishing Hole"

01:43.590 --> 01:48.590
"Erica Blige Dead.
The Mystery Deepens!! Suicide or Murder?"

01:43.590 --> 01:48.590
The experts conclude that from the
remaining evidence, it was a suicide...

01:48.590 --> 01:50.720
"Erica Blige Dead.
The Mystery Deepens!! Suicide or Murder?"

01:52.100 --> 01:55.630
But there's no apparent suicide motive

01:55.630 --> 01:59.600
for the diva who's sold
over 20 million records...

01:59.600 --> 02:02.470
There're rumors that the
politically outspoken Erica

02:02.470 --> 02:05.610
was silenced by the FBI.

02:05.610 --> 02:08.450
Hmm? Hey, Ryusuke!

02:08.450 --> 02:11.950
Did you see the
President's condolence statement?

02:11.950 --> 02:15.890
Boy, that Erica sure was incredible,
mourned by even the President himself.

02:17.120 --> 02:18.290
Hmm?

02:18.290 --> 02:24.290
"'Requiem for Erica' Worldwide Release-
A Passionate Farewell Song
by her lover, Malcolm"

02:27.330 --> 02:32.270
"Live 13
'Ciel Bleu"'

02:40.440 --> 02:42.610
So, how are things with Izumi-chan?

02:42.610 --> 02:45.940
I haven't seen her since that day
during summer vacation.

02:47.610 --> 02:49.240
What about Maho-chan?

02:51.280 --> 02:54.310
I haven't seen her...
since that day either...

02:56.120 --> 02:57.750
Hey! Koyuki!

03:17.640 --> 03:20.630
I don't mind joining your band!

03:22.480 --> 03:23.810
Oh...

03:23.810 --> 03:25.980
Bet no one else wants to play with you,

03:25.980 --> 03:30.650
seeing how completely
ostracized guys you are!

03:30.650 --> 03:33.320
Can you play an instrument?

03:33.320 --> 03:35.760
I'll be doing the vocals!

03:38.760 --> 03:41.870
Anyway, I want to stand out
at the Cultural Festival

03:41.870 --> 03:43.770
and be popular with chicks!

03:43.770 --> 03:48.140
To that end, I don't even care if it means
getting on Hyodo's gang's bad side!

03:49.110 --> 03:54.280
You sure are a gutsy fella in a way.

03:54.280 --> 03:58.610
With my networking, I can
guarantee us an excellent bassist!

04:02.450 --> 04:04.180
I'm really something!

04:10.290 --> 04:13.130
That's 60,000 yen per person.

04:13.130 --> 04:15.800
We can't pay that much...

04:15.800 --> 04:17.300
Oh boy...

04:17.300 --> 04:20.140
Fine, I'll give you kids
a student discount.

04:20.140 --> 04:23.310
Anyway, recordings do cost money...

04:23.310 --> 04:29.880
But by selling our CDs at performances,
Beck receives greater exposure.

04:29.880 --> 04:31.350
Let's go for it!

04:31.350 --> 04:34.320
We have to strike while the iron's hot.

04:34.320 --> 04:38.920
Yeah! I think I'm on fire!

04:38.920 --> 04:42.590
Well, I guess I'm off to work.

04:42.590 --> 04:45.260
Chiba-kun, what are you doing now?

04:45.260 --> 04:49.100
Hmm? Working on a new drug.

04:49.100 --> 04:51.030
I'll be back in about a week.

05:05.620 --> 05:08.350
Yeah! Alright!

05:09.290 --> 05:13.790
Wishing upon a star

05:13.790 --> 05:18.790
We are apparition beasts

05:20.460 --> 05:23.300
We fight for justice

05:23.300 --> 05:26.640
And someday we'll be reborn

05:26.640 --> 05:31.980
"We want to become human!"

05:31.980 --> 05:37.080
Blast away our dark destinies

05:37.080 --> 05:40.080
"Bem! Bella! Bello!"

05:40.080 --> 05:42.750
Apparition beasts

05:42.750 --> 05:45.920
Ta-dah! The name of the band shall be...

05:46.920 --> 05:49.090
Ciel Bleu.

05:49.090 --> 05:50.330
"Ciel Bleu (French)
'Blue Sky"'

05:50.330 --> 05:52.260
"Ciel Bleu (French)
'Blue Sky"'

05:50.330 --> 05:52.260
Sounds like some kind of candy.

05:52.260 --> 05:54.860
"Ciel Bleu (French)
'Blue Sky"'

05:52.260 --> 05:54.860
It's "blue sky" in French.

05:56.770 --> 05:58.770
Don't you think the chicks will dig it?

05:58.770 --> 06:00.600
Well, yeah...I guess...

06:00.600 --> 06:02.440
Let's wrap this up already.

06:02.440 --> 06:04.440
Uh-huh.

06:04.440 --> 06:06.740
Look over there!

06:19.960 --> 06:22.950
What's a bunch of trash
like you doing here?

06:33.970 --> 06:36.570
You really tick me off.

06:36.570 --> 06:39.970
I'm a fan of your father's band.

06:42.910 --> 06:45.040
Don't you talk about my father!

06:48.090 --> 06:51.180
My mom's got all their CDs...
So I listened to them.

06:57.090 --> 06:59.490
Mother and son, two generations of fans.

07:08.770 --> 07:09.930
Let's go.

07:11.280 --> 07:12.940
You sure?

07:12.940 --> 07:14.430
Hey, wait up!

07:18.280 --> 07:20.120
Saku, are you alright?

07:20.120 --> 07:23.290
Yeah, I'm okay. It didn't hurt at all.

07:23.290 --> 07:25.290
Well, when you go
back to school tomorrow,

07:25.290 --> 07:30.460
your textbooks and notes will
be incinerated by those guys.

07:30.460 --> 07:35.800
Huh? Yeah, but I just don't think
that Hyodo is such a rotten guy

07:35.800 --> 07:37.900
underneath it all.

07:37.900 --> 07:42.410
What?! But why? Are you serious?

07:42.410 --> 07:44.100
I agree with him too.

07:48.910 --> 07:50.280
You idiot!

07:50.280 --> 07:52.750
You're the one suffering the most!

07:52.750 --> 07:54.880
Is this some kind of bizarre empathy?

07:56.750 --> 08:00.150
It's true; he can get under your skin...

08:01.260 --> 08:04.350
He can really push your buttons, but...

08:06.260 --> 08:10.460
I love his guitar.

08:13.770 --> 08:15.940
Hey, is that you, Tanabe?

08:15.940 --> 08:17.940
Eh, Esumi-san!

08:17.940 --> 08:20.780
Are you on your way home
from band practice?

08:20.780 --> 08:27.950
Yup, um...we're going to...
present you with a song!

08:27.950 --> 08:29.450
Wow, that's so cool!

08:29.450 --> 08:32.790
I'll be cheering from the front-row seat!

08:32.790 --> 08:34.480
So cute...

08:38.400 --> 08:44.900
Alright! I'm on a roll!
We'll be back in the studio tomorrow!

08:44.900 --> 08:48.240
Yeah, you're right.

08:48.240 --> 08:50.570
If we're going to do it,
we've got to do our best!

08:50.570 --> 08:54.080
Umm, Sherry...What are we called again?

08:54.080 --> 08:56.580
Ciel Bleu! It's the Blue Sky!

08:56.580 --> 09:00.920
It's our youth! Esumi-san!

09:00.920 --> 09:02.250
"Higashi Middle Festival-
Uplifting Power of Youth"

09:02.250 --> 09:05.720
"Higashi Middle Festival-
Uplifting Power of Youth"

09:02.250 --> 09:05.720
Please vote for the
Higashi Middle contest...

09:05.720 --> 09:06.760
"Higashi Middle Festival-
Uplifting Power of Youth"

09:05.720 --> 09:06.760
I'm going to be in it too!

09:06.760 --> 09:07.320
I'm going to be in it too!

09:07.320 --> 09:09.590
Welcome to our haunted house...

09:11.090 --> 09:14.500
"Yakisoba [Fried Noodles]"

09:11.090 --> 09:14.500
"Yakisoba 180 yen"

09:11.090 --> 09:14.500
-Um, can I get one order of yakisoba?
-Yep!

09:14.500 --> 09:14.760
"Yakisoba [Fried Noodles]"

09:14.500 --> 09:14.760
"Yakisoba 180 yen"

09:15.600 --> 09:17.690
Hey, don't be eating there.

09:32.280 --> 09:33.610
Hey, Koyuki!

09:36.720 --> 09:38.560
Are you okay?

09:38.560 --> 09:40.890
So, when are you on?

09:41.890 --> 09:44.230
Pretty soon...We'll be rehearsing.

09:44.230 --> 09:46.060
Hey, where's Chiba-kun?

09:46.060 --> 09:48.600
He ran off to the bathroom.

09:48.600 --> 09:51.600
I guess he got food poisoning from that.

09:51.600 --> 09:52.070
"Candied Apples"

09:52.070 --> 09:54.730
"Candied Apples"

09:52.070 --> 09:54.730
There. Thank you.

09:59.410 --> 10:01.340
Darn it, that Saku...

10:02.410 --> 10:03.740
Huh?

10:11.760 --> 10:13.920
Hey, it's been a while.

10:13.920 --> 10:16.090
Yeah, you're looking well.

10:22.770 --> 10:25.600
You're right. It's rotten.

10:25.600 --> 10:27.840
Saku, we're going soon.

10:27.840 --> 10:28.600
Uh-huh.

10:37.210 --> 10:40.380
I've had enough of you, you extortionist!

10:40.380 --> 10:42.410
Extortion? What the?

10:43.490 --> 10:44.610
Hmm?

10:48.390 --> 10:51.230
I can't find my Dying Breed t-shirt...

10:51.230 --> 10:52.730
Me neither.

10:52.730 --> 10:53.860
This is awful!

10:53.860 --> 10:56.070
I can't find my t-shirt!

10:56.070 --> 10:57.900
Ours are gone, too.

10:57.900 --> 11:00.240
-What shall we do?
-This must be Hyodo's doing.

11:00.240 --> 11:01.570
Koyuki!

11:01.570 --> 11:02.600
Come here!

11:20.090 --> 11:21.520
This is terrible...

11:24.260 --> 11:27.390
I begged my mom to buy that shirt for me.

11:29.600 --> 11:33.590
My, what are you guys doing there?

11:46.450 --> 11:48.040
What are we going to do, Koyuki?

11:49.790 --> 11:51.460
It's alright.

11:51.460 --> 11:54.580
We'll perform wearing our gym clothes.

12:26.660 --> 12:29.420
Chiba's been in the crapper
for quite a while...

12:30.490 --> 12:35.260
Let's see...Ah! We're last on the list!

12:36.770 --> 12:38.360
We're after Hyodo's group.

12:40.270 --> 12:44.260
The bands are listed in alphabetical order
by the band's representative.

12:56.790 --> 12:59.310
Oh boy...They're great.

13:01.790 --> 13:03.960
They aren't at a school level.

13:03.960 --> 13:05.460
Yeah...

13:05.460 --> 13:07.660
These boys sure are good!

13:09.130 --> 13:15.340
So sweet, I kill you

13:15.340 --> 13:21.310
So sweet, I kill them all, kill them all

13:21.310 --> 13:23.150
So sweet...

13:23.150 --> 13:26.650
-Hmm...He's good, that's true,

13:23.150 --> 13:26.650
-So sweet...

13:26.650 --> 13:30.650
but although his technique is good,
that guitar lacks feeling.

13:30.650 --> 13:32.990
-But although his technique is good,
that guitar lacks feeling.

13:30.650 --> 13:32.990
-I kill them all.

13:36.160 --> 13:37.290
Yeah!

13:48.270 --> 13:50.940
Eddy taught me this...

13:50.940 --> 13:54.780
The guitar is a personality,
coming out of six strings...

13:54.780 --> 13:56.850
What's important is the personality

13:56.850 --> 14:00.620
that comes across
on the six strings of a guitar...

14:00.620 --> 14:04.850
Performing last is the band, Ciel Bleu!

14:06.290 --> 14:09.130
Hey, don't come out!

14:09.130 --> 14:11.150
No one wants to hear you play!

14:12.800 --> 14:14.700
Go back, Tanaka!

14:16.470 --> 14:18.130
Stop playing!

14:18.130 --> 14:20.540
Don't come out!

14:20.540 --> 14:21.700
Huh!? Uh...

14:22.810 --> 14:27.810
I'm sorry...I can't go on.
You handle the rest.

14:27.810 --> 14:29.370
Ah! Tanabe!

14:32.480 --> 14:34.820
What are we going to do, Saku?

14:34.820 --> 14:37.920
The show must go on.

14:37.920 --> 14:39.080
Uh-huh.

14:40.420 --> 14:43.920
-Go home! Go home!
-Yeah, get out of here!

14:58.280 --> 15:01.180
Everyone, settle down!

15:01.180 --> 15:03.440
-It's no use.
-We don't wanna hear you!

15:08.950 --> 15:10.280
Damn!

15:18.630 --> 15:19.820
Shut up!

15:22.330 --> 15:25.100
-Hmm?
-What?

15:27.640 --> 15:30.470
Listen up!

15:30.470 --> 15:33.480
This is the first and last time

15:33.480 --> 15:38.250
you're going to hear Koyuki sing
in a shoddy gymnasium like this!

15:38.250 --> 15:39.310
Hmm...

16:09.110 --> 16:10.450
Well said.

16:10.450 --> 16:12.110
It's the truth.

16:21.630 --> 16:26.460
Living in the darkness, hiding

16:26.460 --> 16:28.300
We are apparition beasts

16:28.300 --> 16:31.100
-Koyuki's guitar's gotten pretty good.

16:28.300 --> 16:31.100
-We are apparition beasts

16:33.140 --> 16:35.970
-Yeah, he's been playing in Beck.
-Wow, Tanaka can sing and play the guitar!

16:33.140 --> 16:35.970
-Unable to show ourselves

16:35.970 --> 16:39.410
-Yeah, he's been playing in Beck.
-Wow, Tanaka can sing and play the guitar!

16:35.970 --> 16:39.410
-Not these bestial bodies

16:39.410 --> 16:40.080
-Isn't Tanaka-kun awesome?
-He's so cool!

16:40.080 --> 16:45.580
-Isn't Tanaka-kun awesome?
-He's so cool!

16:40.080 --> 16:45.580
-"We want to become human!"

16:45.580 --> 16:50.750
Blast away our dark destinies

16:50.750 --> 16:54.090
"Bem! Bella! Bello!"

16:54.090 --> 16:56.290
Apparition beasts

17:07.770 --> 17:12.280
Wishing upon a star

17:12.280 --> 17:16.910
We are apparition beasts

17:19.280 --> 17:22.020
We fight for justice

17:22.020 --> 17:24.780
And someday we'll be reborn

17:26.790 --> 17:30.020
"We want to become human!"

17:31.630 --> 17:36.900
Blast away our dark destinies

17:36.900 --> 17:40.070
"Bem! Bella! Bello!"

17:40.070 --> 17:42.910
Apparition beasts

17:42.910 --> 17:45.740
"Bem! Bella! Bello!"

17:45.740 --> 17:50.080
Apparition beasts

17:50.080 --> 17:51.980
-Yo, Masaru...
-Ah...

18:05.930 --> 18:08.430
Thank you for your patience.

18:08.430 --> 18:10.770
I will now announce the results.

18:10.770 --> 18:12.940
Hey, is it going to be Tanaka?

18:12.940 --> 18:14.600
It's Hyodo!

18:14.600 --> 18:16.270
I liked Kiss-Kiss-Kiss!

18:16.270 --> 18:19.970
This year's Higashi Middle School Festival,
Battle of the Bands winner is...

18:20.940 --> 18:24.040
Ciel Bleu, Blue Sky!

18:29.950 --> 18:32.620
Hey, how come Tanabe's up there?

18:32.620 --> 18:33.790
Saku!

18:33.790 --> 18:36.290
Doesn't that look like the Grammy award?

18:36.290 --> 18:37.450
Tanaka-kun!

18:45.740 --> 18:47.740
Hey, Koyuki.

18:47.740 --> 18:50.260
Chiba wants to see you at
the back of the school building.

18:51.440 --> 18:54.410
Huh? But why?

18:54.410 --> 18:58.400
Next, we will announce the winner
of the best guitar award...

19:00.320 --> 19:02.910
This year's best guitar award goes to...

19:04.920 --> 19:06.590
What's up, Rikiya-kun?

19:06.590 --> 19:07.820
You stupid idiot!

19:11.430 --> 19:16.930
Hey, Masaru! When did I ask to
get reimbursed for that guitar?

19:16.930 --> 19:18.660
Huh? What's this?

19:20.100 --> 19:23.900
He apologized to the owner and
that guitar incident is over already!

19:26.610 --> 19:29.610
100,000 yen for reimbursement?

19:29.610 --> 19:31.810
How dare you use my name like that!

19:32.780 --> 19:34.620
I'm sorry.

19:34.620 --> 19:35.450
Help...

19:35.450 --> 19:40.220
Taking advantage...
I hate that kind of thing!

19:42.730 --> 19:44.820
Hey, that's enough. Stop it.

19:46.060 --> 19:51.230
I'm sorry. Please forgive me...

19:51.230 --> 19:52.500
Damn!

19:55.240 --> 19:57.210
Hey, kid.

19:58.410 --> 20:00.510
Sorry 'bout that.

20:00.510 --> 20:04.080
Ah...no...

20:04.080 --> 20:09.540
I'll make sure that Masaru pays you
back the entire 50,000 yen you paid.

20:10.920 --> 20:14.080
I-I'm sorry!

20:15.430 --> 20:17.390
I'm...sorry...

20:19.430 --> 20:21.920
Damn, you're despicable!

20:23.600 --> 20:27.830
"Higashi Middle School Festival"

20:47.720 --> 20:51.060
What's with that trophy?

20:51.060 --> 20:53.790
It's the award for the Best Guitarist.

21:06.240 --> 21:10.040
Well, I'll leave it here for you.

21:29.270 --> 21:33.000
This one's broken, so I'll take it.

21:34.100 --> 21:37.440
Momoko-sensei said she'll be
getting the other one next week.

21:45.620 --> 21:51.620
Even though the results showed a tie,
I still think you're a better player.

21:51.620 --> 21:52.920
Of course!

21:58.630 --> 22:01.460
I got some bandages for you.

22:01.460 --> 22:06.140
But you managed to get
this good in just one year.

22:06.140 --> 22:10.330
In my opinion, you're the
first worthy rival I've met.

22:19.650 --> 22:22.580
Pretty dismal isn't it, that trophy?

22:50.410 --> 22:52.510
Another minute

22:52.510 --> 22:55.200
Feelin' so fine

22:57.510 --> 22:59.750
You turn the freeze

22:59.750 --> 23:02.480
into warm light

23:04.590 --> 23:08.060
Had a premonition

23:08.060 --> 23:10.730
I've been waitin' ever since

23:10.730 --> 23:14.230
My world comin' down

23:14.230 --> 23:17.030
It's got me spinnin' 'round

23:18.800 --> 23:24.970
If you really wanna fly

23:24.970 --> 23:27.740
you gotta let go

23:39.990 --> 23:42.320
Simply the most

23:42.320 --> 23:44.360
big sensation

23:44.360 --> 23:47.160
(once you're here you won't go back)

23:47.160 --> 23:49.430
She's really pretty

23:49.430 --> 23:51.430
One-eyed vision

23:51.430 --> 23:54.270
(lose the fear it don't come back)

23:54.270 --> 23:57.770
Little sister showed me

23:57.770 --> 24:00.440
Really took me for a ride

24:00.440 --> 24:02.110
My world comin' down

24:02.110 --> 24:05.450
(once you're here you won't go back)

24:05.450 --> 24:09.470
(lose the fear it don't come back)

24:13.920 --> 24:18.260
Wow, the way the sound of the horns
reverberates throughout...

24:18.260 --> 24:20.190
Gotta love it-Chinatown.
